{"id":27871,"slug":"12-angry-men","title":"12 Angry Men","year":1957,"country":"United States","duration":96,"spine":591,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/27871-12-angry-men","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/52d04b1177f128f29d27ec6dbaa5d311/dNXcCSgsZzxlAzK4pbnHCZKlijRbmv_large.jpg","description":"12 Angry Men, directed by Sidney Lumet, may be the most radical courtroom drama in cinema history. A behind-closed-doors look at the American legal system that is as riveting as it is spare, this iconic adaptation of Reginald Rose’s teleplay stars Henry Fonda as the dissenting member on a jury of white men ready to pass judgment on a Puerto Rican teenager charged with murdering his father. The result is a saga of epic proportions that plays out over a tense afternoon in one sweltering room. Lumet’s electrifying snapshot of 1950s America on the verge of change is one of the great feature-film debuts.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Sidney Lumet","slug":"sidney-lumet"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Martin Balsam","role":"Juror 1","slug":"martin-balsam"},{"actor":"John Fiedler","role":"Juror 2","slug":"john-fiedler"},{"actor":"Lee J. Cobb","role":"Juror 3","slug":"lee-j-cobb"},{"actor":"E. G. Marshall","role":"Juror 4","slug":"e-g-marshall"},{"actor":"Jack Klugman","role":"Juror 5","slug":"jack-klugman"},{"actor":"Edward Binns","role":"Juror 6","slug":"edward-binns"},{"actor":"Jack Warden","role":"Juror 7","slug":"jack-warden"},{"actor":"Henry Fonda","role":"Juror 8","slug":"henry-fonda"},{"actor":"Joseph Sweeney","role":"Juror 9","slug":"joseph-sweeney"},{"actor":"Ed Begley","role":"Juror 10","slug":"ed-begley"},{"actor":"George Voskovec","role":"Juror 11","slug":"george-voskovec"},{"actor":"Robert Webber","role":"Juror 12","slug":"robert-webber"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Sidney Lumet","slug":"sidney-lumet"},{"role":"Writer","person":"Reginald Rose","slug":null},{"role":"Producer","person":"Henry Fonda","slug":"henry-fonda"}